Steve’s Tabernacle
- Coin flip for the catalytic converter - $20 a try | [if {catalytic_sold_bar} == false] [else="hide"]
	set {Global.player_money} -= 20
	Call it
	- Heads
		if {Global.coinflip()} == true:
			It is...
			Heads! Congrats!
			You get a catalytic converter
			do Inventory.add_item("Catalytic_Converter")
			set {catalytic_sold_bar} = true
			do Global.use_action()
		else:
			It is...
			Tails! You lose!
			do Global.use_action()
	- Tails
		if {Global.coinflip()} == true:
			It is..
			Congrats! you won!
			You get a catalytic converter
			do Inventory.add_item("Catalytic_Converter")
			set {catalytic_sold_bar} = true
			do Global.use_action()
		else:
			It is...
			Heads! You lose!
			do Global.use_action()
- Ask for Shelter
	if {Global.is_catholic()} == true:
		You have a few drinks and you let it spill that you are now Catholic. The bartender insists you donate to the needy, for he is part of the needy.
		You lose 25 money
		set {Global.player_money} -= 25
		do Global.sleep()
	else:
		You have a few drinks and you things get a little rowdy...
		You wake up with bloody knuckles and a bruise on your face
		You lose 15 resolve
		do Global.change_resolve(-15)
		do Global.sleep()
- Leave